{"id":469,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自主自学で学びを深める甲陽学院","feature_description":"甲陽学院中学校・高等学校は、明朗・潑溂・無邪気の校風のもと、自主性と創造性を伸ばす6年一貫教育を行う学校です。学校行事やクラブ活動は生徒の自主的な運営を重んじ、学習と活動を両立しながら個性と教養を磨けます。落ち着いた環境の中で、仲間と支え合いながら深く学べる点が特徴です。自分で考え、行動する姿勢を自然に鍛えられます。クラブも自主性が生きる場です。","clubs":[{"id":9274,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9275,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9276,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9277,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9278,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9279,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9280,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9281,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9282,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9283,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9284,"name":"物理部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9285,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9286,"name":"鉄道研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9287,"name":"化学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.ko